If the user taps the image menu, I'm thinking the route push should maybe be asynchronous after a pump. The test seems to have used `await tester.pumpAndSettle();`, which suggests the route is complete now. After that, I guess we should dismiss it later. I’m curious about whether the functionality allows for a canPop command to work correctly here! I want to ensure that everything functions smoothly for the user.
